<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Astra estimates '96 profit $48.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Astra estimates '96 profit $48.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine oil firm Astra CAPSA said Wednesday it estimated its annual net profit was $48.8 million in 1996.</p>
<p>In a letter to the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange, Astra said it would announce its final results once an external audit had been completed.</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
